OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with persistent and
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading
OL,7,Fnorth in the morning. Further showery
OL,8,Frain in the afternoon, occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy with a chance of thunder.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FBright spells and a few
OL,12,Fshowers at first, heavy at times, but
OL,13,Fthese gradually fading out through the
OL,14,Fevening. Increasingly cloudy with the
OL,15,Fodd light shower overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FCloudy with dry spells and
OL,18,Fa scattering of generally light
OL,19,Fshowers at first. Some bright spells
OL,20,Fand the odd heavy shower possible in
OL,21,Fthe afternoon. Breezy in the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
