OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FPatchy light rain clears Thursday
OL,7,Fmorning, then drier and brighter.
OL,8,FMostly cloudy on Friday and Saturday
OL,9,Fwith showers or longer spells of rain
OL,10,Fat times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
